msgstr "toute taille"

#. Context: Settings › Data › slider description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:774
#, no-python-format
msgid "0% flags every held ex-date; raise it to only badge your larger positions."
msgstr ""
"À 0 %, chaque date de détachement est signalée ; augmente-le pour ne signaler que tes "
"plus grosses positions."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:785
msgid "Dividend cut / suspension alerts"
msgstr "Alertes de baisse / suspension du dividende"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:786
msgid "Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just cut or suspended."
msgstr ""
"Signaler une position sur le tableau de bord quand son dividende vient d'être réduit "
"ou suspendu."

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle title
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:794
msgid "Dividend increase alerts"
msgstr "Alertes de hausse du dividende"

#. Context: Settings › Data › toggle description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:795
msgid "Flag a holding on the Dashboard when its dividend was just raised."
msgstr ""
"Signaler une position sur le tableau de bord quand son dividende vient d'être augmenté."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:804
msgid "Dividend withholding"
msgstr "Retenue à la source sur les dividendes"

#. Context: Settings › Dividend withholding description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:805
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Default withholding tax % applied when you record a dividend on each exchange — always "
"editable per record. Depends on your own tax residency and treaty, which this app has "
"no way to know, so every rate starts at 0% until you set it."
msgstr ""
"Taux de retenue à la source par défaut appliqué quand tu enregistres un dividende sur "
"chaque bourse, toujours modifiable par enregistrement. Il dépend de ta résidence "
"fiscale et de la convention applicable, que l'application ne peut pas connaître : "
"chaque taux commence donc à 0 % jusqu'à ce que tu le définisses."

#. Context: Settings › section heading
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:825
msgid "Import & export"
msgstr "Import et export"

#. Context: Settings › Import portfolio description
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:832
msgid ""
"Upload an Excel file to import positions, sold history and dividends. This replaces "
"all existing portfolio data for this account."
msgstr ""
"Importe un fichier Excel pour charger positions, historique des ventes et dividendes. "
"Cela remplace toutes les données de portefeuille existantes de ce compte."

#. Context: Settings › file upload label
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:833
msgid "Choose your portfolio .xlsx file"
msgstr "Choisis ton fichier de portefeuille .xlsx"

#. Context: Settings › loading message during import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:836
msgid "Parsing Excel…"
msgstr "Lecture du fichier Excel…"

#. Context: Settings › import error. Keep the exchange codes as they are.
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:840
msgid ""
"No open EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX: positions found. Check that your file matches "
"the expected format."
msgstr ""
"Aucune position ouverte EBR:/AMS:/EPA:/BIT:/ETR:/SWX: trouvée. Vérifie que ton fichier "
"respecte le format attendu."

#. Context: Settings › success message after import
#: uvalu/pages_/settings.py:849
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Imported {open} open, {sold} sold, {dividends} dividend records."
msgstr "Importé : {open} ouvertes, {sold} vendues, {dividends} dividendes."

